meta {
  name: Get Dashboard
  type: http
  seq: 16
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/stats/dashboard
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get Dashboard

  This request is used to get inventory dashboard. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and have a protected routes.

  ## Responses

  **200 — stats fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "stats fetched",
    "data": {
      "total_item": 14,
      "total_fav": 4,
      "total_low": 0,
      "last_added": "New Balance",
      "most_category": {
        "context": "Skin & Body Care",
        "total": 8
      },
      "highest_price": {
        "inventory_name": "New Balance",
        "inventory_price": 2249000
      }
    }
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — stats failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "stats not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}